# apps/api, apps/worker, and apps/agent all build with the repo root as their context (so their
# Dockerfiles can COPY multiple projects' .csproj files for restore caching) - without this file,
# every build sends the *entire* monorepo to the Docker daemon, including apps/frontend's
# node_modules (several hundred MB) and every project's local bin/obj output.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
uploads
samples
**/*.user
.vs
.vscode
